WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.840
In the Temple courts, rich people
pour large sums into the treasury.

2
00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:08.770
Then a poor widow drops
in two small coins.

3
00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:13.670
In a house at Bethany, a woman breaks
a jar of costly perfume and pours it on

4
00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:15.080
Jesus' head.

5
00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:16.840
Some guests complain.

6
00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:20.400
It could have been sold
for more than 300 denarii.

7
00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:24.840
So why did Jesus praise these
two women above everyone else?

8
00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:28.650
In this mission, you'll read
Jesus' own words about the widow,

9
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.830
and find out just how small her gift was.

10
00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:36.070
Then you'll weigh up how Christians
follow her example today.

11
00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:39.920
Your mission: find out why
Jesus praised two women,

12
00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:42.680
with their copper coins
and their jar of perfume.
